TX timing like the macOS engine: early wake + spin, DSCP EF on audio

TX_WAKE_EARLY_NS / TX_SPIN_NS: a late wake-up costs spin time instead of a late packet.
Audio flow sockets are marked DSCP EF (46) like Dante hardware; a switch
with Dante QoS otherwise queues them as best effort.

